        <Description ?01M05F1P6GC8XEZFP0EAF7DN3E>
        压缩阈值迁移为通用配置机制承载的可配置项。方案已确认：symbiont ResourceVFS + ai-support RuntimeConfigVfsLoader + terminal 构造 VFS + runtime-config.json。
        </?01M05F1P6GC8XEZFP0EAF7DN3E>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task #G4-T1 { name = "创建并执行压缩阈值参数化 track" status = "DONE" order = 0 } (
            <TrackLink #parameterize-tool-result-compaction-thresholds { state = "bound" project_ref = "host" }>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #VERIFY { name = "总体验收" status = "DONE" order = 4 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1P6GC8XEZFP0EAF7DN3F>
        验证 mission 成功判据：read 语义对齐、可见性循环消除、阈值配置化落地。
        </?01M05F1P6GC8XEZFP0EAF7DN3F>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task #VERIFY-T1 { name = "运行 read 工具、loader、可见性相关测试" status = "DONE" order = 0 }>
          <Task #VERIFY-T2 { name = "检查无隐式双默认与无 repeat-read 循环" status = "DONE" order = 1 }>
        ]>
      )>
    ]>
  )>
  <Schedule [
    <Dag { for = "space_improve-file-read-efficiency-and-context-reuse" } [
      <Node #G2 [
        <After { ref = "G1" }>
      ]>
      <Node #G3 [
